Subject: [PATCH 1/6] qsa: FP8 E4M3 KV reader for sm_86 with static K/V scale
 sidecar (VLLM_QSA_KV_SCALES)

Applies on vllm v0.28.0 + the eight release/qwen38next_offload commits (patches/upstream/):
the ple_layer.py hunk sits at the top of _get_ple_embedding_quant_method, ahead of the
upstream Fp8Config / ModelOptNvFp4Config dispatch, which is preserved unchanged after the
VLLM_PLE_FP8_GLOBAL_SCALE gate.
